&lt;p&gt;You will notice little &#039;📈&#039; emojis beside some articles. That denotes SCP articles which were under 30 and tales which were under 20 when this edition of site news was posted. Give them a little love! Speaking from personal experience, the most frustrating thing that can happen to an article is not deletion, but stagnating below 20 without any comments. So try to read, vote, and comment on these articles! They&#039;re often hidden gems :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Week of August 1st:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;SCPs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5738&quot;&gt;SCP-5738&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;Opportunity Shackles&amp;quot;) - The unemployment, it&#039;s terrible, isn&#039;t it? Flopmind can talk about that, they know what it is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5271&quot;&gt;SCP-5271&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;there is a god, and they are a penguin&amp;quot;) - Yeah. That&#039;s it, that&#039;s the thing. Written by chiifu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5971&quot;&gt;SCP-5971&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;A Moment Where Words Don&#039;t Reach&amp;quot;) - And if they can&#039;t reach the exit of our mouth, they can&#039;t reach for the stars. Written by RockTeethMothEyes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📈 &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-088-pt&quot;&gt;SCP-088-PT&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;This machine kills communists&amp;quot;) - For some people, the old fights a la Pete Seeger stopped being the priority, alas. Written by Vintner, translated by INT_Translator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📈 &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5910&quot;&gt;SCP-5910&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;This is a true story.&amp;quot;) - We&#039;re not the type of people who try to hide the truth, oh no. Story writ&amp;#8230; told by ThisMightBeAuto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5079&quot;&gt;SCP-5079&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;Isolation Reverie&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot;) - Hey, don&#039;t act like it was something new. Everyone do that. Reveries are cool. Dreamed by Grigori Karpin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5074&quot;&gt;SCP-5074&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;Childhoods End, and Bubbles Burst&amp;quot;) - &lt;em&gt;Say goodbye to the thrills of life / When love was good, life was bad&lt;/em&gt;. Bubbles buried in a jungle by Tyumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5801&quot;&gt;SCP-5801&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;Snowman Heaven&amp;quot;) - Snowmen go under the sun when they want to die. Written by FluffyDog00.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📈 &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1329-ru-ex&quot;&gt;SCP-1329-RU-EX&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;A Little Big Adventure&amp;quot;) - And this time, Frédérick Raynal and Media Molecule have nothing to do with it. For real. Written by Arbelict.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5206&quot;&gt;SCP-5206&lt;/a&gt; (&amp;quot;Threads&amp;quot;) - Hey, I know it&#039;s not a thing we&#039;re supposed to do, but if that interests you, Thread is here again, it&#039;s open. And the admins are all asleep, they can&#039;t see. How do I know it? Talk to DrAkimoto, man.&lt;/li&gt;
