&lt;li&gt;📈 &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/the-antiquarian&quot;&gt;The Antiquarian&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;To have one of his beloved treasures conspire against him… he could find no pleasure in the irony.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Meska.&lt;/li&gt;
