oncluded a partnership with Adult Swim &amp; Williams Street for this. Nothing can go wrong. Hosted by erkdaclerk.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5982">SCP-5982</a> (&quot;The Smoke Gets In Your Eyes&quot;) - <em>Cigarettes and cigarettes, the Head Researcher thinks I stink / I've got burn holes on my report, all my homies think I stink</em>. Smoked by Rounderhouse.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-cn-767">SCP-CN-767</a> (&quot;Chart Syndrome&quot;) - No hit-parades have been involved in this article. Written by breaddddd, translated by INT_Translator.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-pl-052">SCP-PL-052</a> (&quot;Subtemporal Bracer&quot;) - Yep, we truly need to brace ourselves. Literally. Written by Fs-ior, translated by INT_Translator.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Tales</span></h4> <ul> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-heart-the-circus-4">For Fear of Falling</a> - &quot;<em>The music began then, dark and discordant, a deep base thrumming in the air like a heartbeat, dipping low enough to be inaudible, but loud enough to still be felt.</em>&quot; Written by MalyceGraves.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/live-air">Live Air</a> - &quot;<em>So, Mr. Malburg, in this regard, if you please, answer on one simple question. Are we cool yet?</em>&quot; Written by Agent Lloyd and Ged_Malburg.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-bed-lifted">The Bed, Lifted</a> - &quot;<em>It didn't take long for him to reach the place where the guys claimed to have witnessed the unimaginable.</em>&quot; Written by EthanHanson.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-cloud-over-lichtenberg">A Cloud Over Lichtenberg</a> - &quot;<em>Judas was not deserving of death at the hands of the Mosquito.</em>&quot; Written by UraniumEmpire.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/falling-into-stars">Falling Into Stars</a> - &quot;<em>My End is My Beginning.</em>&quot; Written by Lyrics Linn, translated by INT_Translator.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mauerzeit-i">Mauerzeit I</a> - &quot;<em>So far 1961 has been a real 2020.</em>&quot; Written by Vezaz.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/capitis">Capitis</a> - &quot;<em>The Romans entered a new age, true. But in order to do so, the Republic had to fall.</em>&quot; Written by Oboebandgeek99.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/catching-up">Catching Up</a> - &quot;<em>Does this have anything to do with the entity that messed with me in ’86?</em>&quot; Written by Grigori Karpin.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/umbra">Umbra</a> - &quot;<em>Anybody would hesitate to step into a living hell.</em>&quot; Written by chiifu.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/goodnight-miss-moon">Goodnight, Miss Moon</a> - &quot;<em>She feeds us seeds of hope and power; we grow stronger.</em>&quot; Written by Luxaiko.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-dire-mother">The Dire Mother</a> - &quot;<em>She tried to run, screamed as a lance of pain slammed from her shoulders to her feet, and fell.</em>&quot; Written by Dr Gears.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/illac">Illac</a> - &quot;<em>Until that final standstill of entropy; protected, while our cells sit frozen.</em>&quot; Written by Lt Flops.</li> <li>📈 <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/working-at-cannibal-chin-s">Working at Cannibal Chin's</a> - &quot;<em>What about an endless supply of french fries?</em>&quot; Written by Marcelles_Raynes.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/class-a-orange-65">Class-A Orange 65</a> - &quot;<em>You guys really fucked up.</em>&quot; Written by daviiid.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/flos">Flos</a> - &quot;<em>For the world has its eye on us.</em>&quot; Written by EstrellaYoshte.</li> </ul> <h4><span>Misc</span></h4> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/goi-formats-audio-edition">GoI Formats - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/foundation-tales-audio-edition">Foundation Tales - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">Canon Renaissance Contest</a> - New contest! Oh boy! Written by Modulum.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph">Seyph's Art Page</a> - &quot;blurb&quot; It's Seyph's art page!</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/art-page-of-allerarey">Art Page of AlleraRey</a> - It's AlleraRey 's art page!</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-6-audio-edition">SCP Series 6 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-5-audio-edition">SCP Series 5 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-4-audio-edition">SCP Series 4 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-3-audio-edition">SCP Series 3 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-2-audio-edition">SCP Series 2 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-series-1-audio-edition">SCP Series 1 - Audio Edition</a> - Written by TSATPWTCOTTTADC.</li> </ul> <h3><span>Fanart</span></h3> <h5><span>Here you will find a selection of artists whose art output is worth following. The thumbnails are clickable.</span></h5> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-green-squid-kid-s-arts-n-crafts">A Green Squid Kid's Arts n' Crafts</a></span> by A Green Squid Kid</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-079 (Cyborg Collie)</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-green-squid-kid-s-arts-n-crafts"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/dog1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="dog1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Fleas</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-green-squid-kid-s-arts-n-crafts"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/dog2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="dog2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Sit. Chase. Play.</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-green-squid-kid-s-arts-n-crafts"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/dog3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="dog3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">Desk of Junior Designer S. Yvonne</a></span> by EstrellaYoshte</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Department of Pataphysical Optics and Noospheric Imaging</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/desk1.png" style="width:33%;" alt="desk1.png" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Overwatch Command</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/desk2.png" style="width:33%;" alt="desk2.png" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Department of Miscommunications</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/desk3.png" style="width:33%;" alt="desk3.png" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph">Seyph's Art Page</a></span> by Seyph</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Temporal Anomalies Department</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/sey1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="sey1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Last Breath</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/sey2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="sey2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">The Nightmare of a Reality Folder</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/galerie-d-illustrations-de-seyph"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/sey3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="sey3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/bobby-mcbobster-skullkandi/gE46_aNUxfV2e1Xr2R23nzkXPG7d2zEGMl">Bobby McBobster's Amino Page</a></span> by Bobby McBobster (SkullKandi)</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-011</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/scp-011/xqPo_jgT2u6rB3Yr72PKzRaJg8apz7q6ml"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/bobby1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="bobby1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">The Gate Guardian</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/the-gate-guardian/PXPE_D1SmuDGkLkYlMeB1Mr4YP74KMkgR2"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/bobby2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="bobby2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-1471</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/redraw-of-scp-1471/YlNa_LZibu1Qx2Z47law3qJaVvgnDmBzeL"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/bobby3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="bobby3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dianas-spectacular-not-really-art-hub">Diana’s Spectacular (Not Really) Art Hub</a></span> by DianaBerry</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">5029 Art</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dianas-spectacular-not-really-art-hub"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/diana1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="diana1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Iris</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dianas-spectacular-not-really-art-hub"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/diana2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="diana2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-4168</span><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dianas-spectacular-not-really-art-hub"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/diana3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="diana3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/knightsofyi/J03g_kpS0f8k8JlWzreMKkvLkkZqWaJ6n">knightofyi's Amino Page</a></span> by knightofyi</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Imagine This</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/knightsofyi/J03g_kpS0f8k8JlWzreMKkvLkkZqWaJ6n"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/knightsofyi1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="knightsofyi1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">Red Reality.</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/knightsofyi/J03g_kpS0f8k8JlWzreMKkvLkkZqWaJ6n"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/knightsofyi2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="knightsofyi2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);">SCP-049 Drawing</span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/knightsofyi/J03g_kpS0f8k8JlWzreMKkvLkkZqWaJ6n"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/news-08-2020/knightsofyi3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="knightsofyi3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span></div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> &#8212;&#8212;</p> <h1><span>Q&amp;A:</span></h1> <h2><span>Q: Can I replace a blurb that you wrote for one of my articles with my own? I'm not satisfied with it.</span></h2> <p>A: Absolutely. You will always have that option at any point.</p> <h2><span>Q: I noticed an error/typo/incorrect information and wish to correct it. May I?</span></h2> <p>A: Sure! If the changes are not limited to your own article(s) and/or are substantial changes across multiple entries, you should post in that month's discussion page and then make the changes.</p> <h2><span>Q: I wrote an article and it seems to have stuck. Can I send a blurb of mine to one of the frequent collaborators?</span></h2> <p>A: Yup! It's much easier if you come to us about it, and it gives you the control over what you want shown on the news page.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>« <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-07-2020">July 2020</a> | <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-08-2020">August 2020</a></span> | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-09-2020">September 2020</a> »</strong></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608733532" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-187416-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. with a rating above 0</div> </div> 
